{"game": "risk-of-rain-2", "language": "english", "appid": 632360, "month": "2020-08", "window": 3, "start_date": 1597536000, "end_date": 1598227199, "month_true_total": 8867, "quota": 9, "returned": 9, "pulled_at": "2026-09-13 02:43:33 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "74808594", "author": {"steamid": "76561198118999431", "personaname": "Doki", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198118999431/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 6566, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5195, "last_played": 1657848858, "avatar": "cf33872ee25d042bb12af6728f24f50148942549"}, "language": "english", "review": "Better than having neh nehs", "timestamp_created": 1598226728, "timestamp_updated": 1598226728, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "74808577", "author": {"steamid": "76561198161939238", "personaname": "Daystrike", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/daystrike/", "num_games_owned": 156, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 4020, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2706, "last_played": 1701043728, "avatar": "c36bdc6d9ac533dcccc0ff2a43ba46268c38a8fa"}, "language": "english", "review": "GAEM\n", "timestamp_created": 1598226700, "timestamp_updated": 1598226700, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "74808569", "author": {"steamid": "76561197976312757", "personaname": "Destyre", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197976312757/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 171, "playtime_forever": 3553, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2715, "last_played": 1735763905, "avatar": "e8587a8a03cd626df143282ab36698e4f1f203ed"}, "language": "english", "review": "Risk of Rain 2 was great during Early Access. You had to pick up as many power-ups as possible, turning yourself into a demi-god that could lay waste to entire armies. However, they'd eventually get you, as time only made things nastier and nastier. It was a sort of a survival game: an arms race versus time itself where death was inevitable, but it was up to you to get as far as possible with your god-like powers, fighting until the bitter end.\n\nNow, post release, the game has a couple of short areas then you fight probably the most annoying boss fight I've played in over 30 years of gaming. Then, it's over. It's ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥. \n\nWhen you wish for a game to be reverted back to an early access state after full release, you know the game has serious problems.", "timestamp_created": 1598226692, "timestamp_updated": 1598816631, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.406124502420425415", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "74808514", "author": {"steamid": "76561198220439649", "personaname": "Burgah!", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198220439649/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 5086, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 289, "last_played": 1738132302, "avatar": "57cbdbbeb97d8b1cb3d16b44f95175f36425e07f"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is very good in thta it has a lot of replay value. Ev